  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Rights Defenders Ethiopia, Phase II 2023-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Rights Defenders Etiopien, Fas II 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsarbete genom att &#xf6;ka s&#xe4;kerheten och den organisatoriska kapaciteten hos m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare, intensifiera arbetet f&#xf6;r unga och kvinnliga m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare, rehabilitering av civilsamh&#xe4;llet i konfliktdrabbade omr&#xe5;den, och st&#xe4;rkt kapacitet att &#xf6;vervaka kr&#xe4;nkningar av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (s) of the contribution is creating enabling environment for human rights work through  increasing safety and organisational capacity of human rights defenders (HRDs), intensifying the work of young and women human rights defenders, rehabilitation of civil society in conflict-affected areas, and strengthened capacity to monitor violations of human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Outcome 1: A vibrant civic space with resilient, capable, and impactful human
rights organizations and human rights defenders
Outcome 2: Human rights organizations engage in efforts to bring accountability
for human rights violations.
Outcome 3: HRDs have safety and security to conduct impactful human rights
work.
Outcome 4: Human rights organizations and HRDs will be able to influence core
agenda of the national dialogue process.</narrative>
  </description>
